{"4270850":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"SCREENSIDE FISHER","steam_appid":4270850,"required_age":0,"is_free":true,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SCREENSIDE FISHER is a chill desktop fishing game you can enjoy in the corner of your screen.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place your character anywhere you like and go about your work or daily tasks. When a fish bites, your character will signal you—and don't worry, the fish will wait until you're ready! Whenever you have a moment, reel it in through a timing mini-game.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4270850\/extras\/cd1cd8c263910c3963cbbe34ce07796e.poster.avif?t=1790482562\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4270850\/extras\/cd1cd8c263910c3963cbbe34ce07796e.webm?t=1790482562\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4270850\/extras\/cd1cd8c263910c3963cbbe34ce07796e.mp4?t=1790482562\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell your catches or use them as ingredients for cooking. Combine various ingredients to discover new recipes, aim for higher star ratings, and complete both your Fish and Recipe Encyclopedias!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4270850\/extras\/3162613d71850774083b28b62dab5f34.poster.avif?t=1790482562\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4270850\/extras\/3162613d71850774083b28b62dab5f34.webm?t=1790482562\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4270850\/extras\/3162613d71850774083b28b62dab5f34.mp4?t=1790482562\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the money you earn to buy new fishing rods, upgrades, cooking ingredients, music, and ambient soundscapes. Meet shopkeepers and fulfill special conditions to unlock shops and bonus features.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4270850\/extras\/5e055bf52e1908f01d5b6c8d3fbf1a32.poster.avif?t=1790482562\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4270850\/extras\/5e055bf52e1908f01d5b6c8d3fbf1a32.webm?t=1790482562\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4270850\/extras\/5e055bf52e1908f01d5b6c8d3fbf1a32.mp4?t=1790482562\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to personalize your space? Use the built-in customization features! Decorate your character’s skin with your favorite images, and add your very own custom fish—setting personalized names, sizes, and custom artwork directly into the game.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4270850\/extras\/be243145d28e40a2f064369f31fa8f20.poster.avif?t=1790482562\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4270850\/extras\/be243145d28e40a2f064369f31fa8f20.webm?t=1790482562\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4270850\/extras\/be243145d28e40a2f064369f31fa8f20.mp4?t=1790482562\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SCREENSIDE FISHER is a chill desktop fishing game you can enjoy in the corner of your screen.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place your character anywhere you like and go about your work or daily tasks. When a fish bites, your character will signal you—and don't worry, the fish will wait until you're ready! Whenever you have a moment, reel it in through a timing mini-game.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4270850\/extras\/cd1cd8c263910c3963cbbe34ce07796e.poster.avif?t=1790482562\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4270850\/extras\/cd1cd8c263910c3963cbbe34ce07796e.webm?t=1790482562\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4270850\/extras\/cd1cd8c263910c3963cbbe34ce07796e.mp4?t=1790482562\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell your catches or use them as ingredients for cooking. Combine various ingredients to discover new recipes, aim for higher star ratings, and complete both your Fish and Recipe Encyclopedias!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4270850\/extras\/3162613d71850774083b28b62dab5f34.poster.avif?t=1790482562\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4270850\/extras\/3162613d71850774083b28b62dab5f34.webm?t=1790482562\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4270850\/extras\/3162613d71850774083b28b62dab5f34.mp4?t=1790482